What about mastynuz? I think this would be a much more realistic 
expectation, all things considered. One monthly publication logging the 
interests, passings, and progress of things Lojban would be quite nice. If 
one or two other people would like to help me coordinate this in some way, I 
would be glad to help publish a monthly news article in Lojban. 
Additionally, if anybody is willing to take up the banner, having 
translations of current world events in Lojban would be oh-so-lovely for 
everybody. It would be lovely practice for the translator, and I'm sure many 
a newbie would appreciate the reading practice.

